g","likes":23,"dislikes":0,"views":5636,"release_date":"1257379200000","length":6468,"description":"A quiet, professional killer, Hyun-jun, arrives at a house to kill a man in his sleep, only to discover a woman alone under the sheets. She shouts at the dazed Hyun-jun, \"What's the matter with you. I paid for you, so just kill me.\" Jin-young has decided to kill herself after a traumatic break up with her lover of seven years, but she wants to go out with a bang, not with a miserable and lonely dose of commonplace sleeping pills. Hyun-jun is furious at the woman and abandons the mission despite the fact that he has a contract to fulfill. \"You should kill yourself; I'm not your suicide assistant.\" This is how Hyun-jun and Jin-young first meet. The most extraordinary love story begins.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.6}],"value":6.6,"age":"r"},"episode_id":11207,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}